---
import '../styles/global.css';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const heart = 'M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78L12 21.23l8.84-8.84a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78Z';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#090f21" />
    <meta name="description" content="Atto XO is building a human-first trading research workspace powered by nonlinear regression and mixed-integer optimization. See the method behind the trade." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Atto XO" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Atto XO — Find the signal. Own the decision." />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Nonlinear market intelligence meets risk-aware MIP and MILP optimization. Built for human traders. In development." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://atto-xo.github.io/" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://atto-xo.github.io/og-preview.svg" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://atto-xo.github.io/og-preview.svg" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Atto XO blue-heart research brand" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Atto XO — Find the signal. Own the decision." />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Research-first decision intelligence for human traders." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://atto-xo.github.io/" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <title>Atto XO — Find the signal. Own the decision.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="site-shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <div class="container header-inner">
          <a class="brand" href="/">
            <span class="brand-atto">atto</span>
            <span class="brand-x">x</span>
            <svg class="brand-heart" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={heart} /></svg>
            <span class="sr-only">o — home</span>
          </a>
          <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
            <a href="#platform">Platform</a>
            <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
            <a href="#principles">Principles</a>
            <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
            <a href="/research-demo/">Research demo</a>
          </nav>
          <a class="header-cta" href="#explore">Explore Atto XO <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <details class="mobile-menu">
            <summary aria-label="Toggle navigation"><span></span><span></span><span></span></summary>
            <nav aria-label="Mobile navigation">
              <a href="#platform">Platform</a>
              <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
              <a href="#principles">Principles</a>
              <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
            <a href="/research-demo/">Research demo</a>
              <a href="#explore">Explore Atto XO</a>
            </nav>
          </details>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main id="main">
        <section class="hero section" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
          <div class="hero-aurora" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="container hero-grid">
            <div class="hero-copy">
              <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> THE NEXT GENERATION OF TRADING RESEARCH <span class="eyebrow-rule"></span> IN DEVELOPMENT</div>
              <h1 id="hero-title">Find the signal.<br /><span class="gradient-text">Own the decision.</span></h1>
              <p class="hero-lead">Markets don’t move in straight lines. Your research shouldn’t either.</p>
              <p class="hero-description">Atto XO brings <strong>nonlinear regression</strong> and <strong>mixed-integer optimization</strong> together to surface risk-aware trade candidates throughout the day — with the human trader always in control.</p>
              <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button button-primary" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                <a class="button button-secondary" href="#platform">Explore the platform <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                <a class="button button-secondary" href="/research-demo/">Try the synthetic demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-note"><span class="note-line"></span> Research-first by design <span class="bullet">·</span> No autonomous execution claims</div>
            </div>

            <div class="preview-wrap">
              <div class="preview-halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <div class="terminal-card" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative Atto XO research dashboard showing a nonlinear model curve, trade candidate review, and optimization checks. Not real market data.">
                <div class="terminal-topbar">
                  <div class="terminal-id"><span class="mini-heart">♥</span> atto xo <span class="terminal-sep">/</span> <span class="muted">research workspace</span></div>
                  <div class="terminal-live"><span></span> CONCEPT PREVIEW</div>
                </div>
                <div class="terminal-header">
                  <div><div class="terminal-kicker">INTRADAY RESEARCH</div><div class="terminal-title">See more than the trend.</div></div>
                  <div class="terminal-chip">MODEL VIEW <span>↗</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="chart-wrap">
                  <div class="chart-labels"><span>Illustrative nonlinear fit</span><span>Confidence region · concept only</span></div>
                  <svg class="market-chart" viewBox="0 0 640 240" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
                    <defs>
                      <linearGradient id="chartFill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#2d64ff" stop-opacity=".28" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2d64ff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient>
                      <linearGradient id="chartLine" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop stop-color="#68b7ff"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#326cff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#92b5ff"/></linearGradient>
                    </defs>
                    <g stroke="#2c3a5c" stroke-width="1" opacity=".65">
                      <path d="M0 40H640M0 95H640M0 150H640M0 205H640"/>
                      <path d="M70 0V240M185 0V240M300 0V240M415 0V240M530 0V240"/>
                    </g>
                    <path d="M0 162C45 175 65 121 105 138S173 195 217 153S284 79 328 112S389 165 437 103S515 50 554 88S602 105 640 31V154C595 202 576 192 548 161S489 142 442 164S373 211 322 174S267 152 216 212S141 190 103 193S38 222 0 219Z" fill="#2864ff" opacity=".12"/>
                    <path d="M0 194C45 203 69 159 112 170S174 213 218 185S287 116 325 138S385 173 432 136S502 78 545 113S603 138 640 82V240H0Z" fill="url(#chartFill)"/>
                    <path d="M0 194C45 203 69 159 112 170S174 213 218 185S287 116 325 138S385 173 432 136S502 78 545 113S603 138 640 82" fill="none" stroke="url(#chartLine)" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <path d="M0 182L42 170L75 190L105 172L147 205L190 183L228 190L273 133L322 151L362 131L405 146L454 109L505 110L557 86L602 112L640 66" fill="none" stroke="#8c99b9" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-dasharray="4 6" opacity=".62"/>
                    <circle cx="545" cy="113" r="7" fill="#78aeff" opacity=".2"/><circle cx="545" cy="113" r="3.5" fill="#91c2ff"/>
                  </svg>
                  <div class="chart-axis"><span>OPEN</span><span>MID-SESSION</span><span>CLOSE</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="terminal-divider"></div>
                <div class="terminal-table-heading"><span>TRADE CANDIDATES <em>illustrative</em></span><span>OPTIMIZATION REVIEW</span></div>
                <div class="trade-row"><span class="asset-icon">A</span><div class="asset"><strong>Candidate A</strong><span>Model signal + scenario</span></div><span class="candidate-tag">Review</span><span class="fit-pill">Within constraints <b>✓</b></span></div>
                <div class="trade-row"><span class="asset-icon alt">B</span><div class="asset"><strong>Candidate B</strong><span>Risk-limited allocation</span></div><span class="candidate-tag muted-tag">Hold</span><span class="fit-pill">Risk screened <b>✓</b></span></div>
                <div class="terminal-footer"><span><span class="tiny-check">✓</span> Human decision required</span><span>SIMULATED DISPLAY · NO LIVE SIGNALS</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="floating-proof"><span class="proof-icon">✧</span><div><strong>Beyond prediction</strong><small>Built to evaluate the trade-off.</small></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="container"><div class="hero-bottom"><span>THE ATTO XO APPROACH</span><div></div><span>MODEL <span>→</span> OPTIMIZE <span>→</span> DECIDE</span></div></div>
        </section>

        <section id="platform" class="section platform-section" aria-labelledby="platform-title">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="section-heading heading-split">
              <div><p class="section-kicker">01 / THE PLATFORM</p><h2 id="platform-title">Smarter models.<br /><span class="subtle">More grounded decisions.</span></h2></div>
              <p class="section-intro">Trading involves more than a forecast. Atto XO is being designed to connect the shape of the market with the constraints of a real decision.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-grid">
              <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-top"><span class="feature-number">/01</span><span class="feature-icon">∿</span></div>
                <div class="feature-visual curve-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 340 95" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 70H340M0 25H340M45 0V95M160 0V95M275 0V95" stroke="#243658" stroke-width="1" /><path d="M4 74Q65 10 116 52T210 49T336 17" fill="none" stroke="#548bff" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M4 81L336 21" fill="none" stroke="#8591ab" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/></svg></div>
                <h3>Nonlinear regression</h3><p>Explore relationships that simple straight-line models miss, and evaluate potential outcomes with uncertainty in view.</p><span class="feature-foot">DISCOVER SIGNAL STRUCTURE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
              </article>
              <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-top"><span class="feature-number">/02</span><span class="feature-icon">▦</span></div>
                <div class="feature-visual bars-visual" aria-hidden="true"><span style="height:44%"></span><span style="height:72%"></span><span style="height:55%"></span><span style="height:88%"></span><span style="height:62%"></span><span style="height:79%"></span><span style="height:38%"></span><span style="height:67%"></span><span style="height:51%"></span></div>
                <h3>MIP &amp; MILP optimization</h3><p>Evaluate discrete trade choices and position sizes against explicit budget, exposure, and risk constraints.</p><span class="feature-foot">MAKE CONSTRAINTS COUNT <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
              </article>
              <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-top"><span class="feature-number">/03</span><span class="feature-icon">◎</span></div>
                <div class="feature-visual decision-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div><span class="decision-dot"></span> MODEL OUTPUT</div><span>↓</span><div><span class="decision-dot green"></span> RISK REVIEW</div><span>↓</span><div class="decision-human"><span class="decision-dot white"></span> HUMAN DECISION</div></div>
                <h3>Human-first by design</h3><p>Explain the model, expose the trade-offs, and leave the final judgment where it belongs: with the trader.</p><span class="feature-foot">TRANSPARENCY OVER AUTOPILOT <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="how-it-works" class="section workflow-section" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="workflow-heading"><p class="section-kicker">02 / THE WORKFLOW</p><h2 id="workflow-title">From market noise<br />to <span class="gradient-text">considered action.</span></h2><p>A proposed research loop designed to separate what the model sees, what the optimizer permits, and what the trader chooses.</p></div>
            <ol class="workflow-list">
              <li><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h3>Observe</h3><p>Capture point-in-time market inputs and preserve a traceable view of the data used.</p></div><span class="step-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◉</span></li>
              <li><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h3>Model</h3><p>Assess nonlinear patterns, scenarios, and forecast uncertainty rather than a single unquestioned number.</p></div><span class="step-symbol" aria-hidden="true">∿</span></li>
              <li><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h3>Optimize</h3><p>Use mixed-integer programming to screen candidate trades under hard allocation and risk rules.</p></div><span class="step-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▦</span></li>
              <li><span class="step-number">04</span><div><h3>Decide</h3><p>Present ranked, explainable candidates for human review, including costs, risks, and provenance.</p></div><span class="step-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="principles" class="section philosophy-section" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
          <div class="container philosophy-grid">
            <div><p class="section-kicker">03 / OUR PRINCIPLES</p><h2 id="principles-title">Powerful intelligence.<br /><span class="gradient-text">Human conviction.</span></h2><p>Optimization can evaluate possibilities. Models can uncover patterns. But context, accountability, and the decision to trade still belong to a person.</p><a class="text-link" href="#roadmap">See what we're building <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
            <div class="principles-list">
              <div><span class="principle-icon">01</span><div><h3>Explain before recommending</h3><p>Make the assumptions, risk rules, and reasons behind a candidate visible.</p></div></div>
              <div><span class="principle-icon">02</span><div><h3>Respect hard limits</h3><p>Constraints are not decorative; a candidate must satisfy the optimization rules to be considered feasible.</p></div></div>
              <div><span class="principle-icon">03</span><div><h3>Separate research from execution</h3><p>Paper recommendations come first. Live execution is not enabled by this site and would require separate authorization.</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="roadmap" class="section roadmap-section" aria-labelledby="roadmap-title">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="section-heading heading-split"><div><p class="section-kicker">04 / DESIGN TARGETS</p><h2 id="roadmap-title">Built for the rhythm<br />of the trading day.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">The intended cadence and output contract are engineering goals, not claims of demonstrated production performance.</p></div>
            <div class="stats-grid">
              <div class="stat"><strong>10<span>min</span></strong><span>Target research cycle</span><p>Freeze eligible inputs and begin a new analysis window.</p></div>
              <div class="stat"><strong>≤5</strong><span>Ranked candidates</span><p>Proposed cap per cycle, with explanations and risk screening.</p></div>
              <div class="stat"><strong>8<span>min</span></strong><span>Target publication window</span><p>Intended time from cycle start, not a delivery guarantee.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="roadmap-note"><span class="roadmap-dot"></span><p><strong>Where we are:</strong> Atto XO is an early-stage, Rust-first research platform. These capabilities and timing objectives describe the intended product, not a live, independently validated trading service.</p></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="explore" class="section cta-section" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
          <div class="container cta-panel">
            <div class="cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="cta-insignia" aria-hidden="true">x<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d={heart}/></svg></div>
            <p class="section-kicker">RESEARCH WITH HEART. TRADE WITH INTENT.</p>
            <h2 id="explore-title">A clearer way to think<br />about <span class="gradient-text">the next trade.</span></h2>
            <p>Follow the development of a trading research tool where model sophistication meets real-world constraints and human judgment.</p>
            <div class="cta-buttons"><a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/atto-xo">Explore Atto XO on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button-secondary" href="https://github.com/atto-xo/atto-xo-rfcs">Read architecture RFCs <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
            <small>Some repositories may require access. No trading account or execution is offered here.</small>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="container footer-top"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="/"><span class="brand-atto">atto</span><span class="brand-x">x</span><svg class="brand-heart" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={heart}/></svg><span class="sr-only">o — home</span></a><span>Market intelligence, made human.</span><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="#platform">Platform</a><a href="#principles">Principles</a><a href="https://github.com/atto-xo">GitHub</a></nav></div>
        <div class="container footer-bottom"><p><strong>Research &amp; risk disclosure.</strong> Atto XO is in development. All charts, screens, and candidate examples are illustrative, not live trading data or forecasts. Nothing here is financial advice, a solicitation, an execution service, or a guarantee of returns. Trading can result in loss of capital.</p><div><span>© {year} Atto XO</span><span>Built for human traders <span class="footer-heart">♥</span></span></div></div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
